                                                "sense_id": "3c73ab53-b682-39d3-89af-46450a283bf1",
                                                "text": "By good fortune, paddle as I pleased, the tide was still sweeping me down; and there lay the Hispaniola right in the fairway, hardly to be missed."
                                            },
